    "name": "Wordban: a text-based Sokoban game",
    "steam_appid": 3126790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/c4584c9c9a66cdc888723dea4de78ae7.webp?t=1750845125\" width=38 height=36 /></span><strong>\u3010New\u3011What have we been up to since we last met?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who participated in the last Next Fest! Based on your feedback, we\u2019ve made the following improvements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoother difficulty curve</strong>: We've restructured the level order to make it easier for newcomers to get started, while offering veteran players a fresh challenge rhythm!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear levels with free exploration</strong>: A brand-new level selection interface that maintains a clear structure while allowing free jumps between levels to revisit your favorites.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope these optimizations bring you a smoother puzzle-solving experience if you're a fan of Sokoban games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the real surprise will be in the upcoming full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/f1c2a2cf9cffae6c7154e5308392ceb2.webp?t=1750845125\" width=38 height=38 /></span><strong>\u3010New\u3011What\u2019s coming in the full version? A sneak peek!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the full version, we\u2019re bringing even more brain-teasing concepts to \u201ctext-based Sokoban\u201d:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*To preserve the ultimate experience of the full version, the following mechanics will not be included in the demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box transformations: </strong><i>Anything can transform</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little critters: </strong><i>Their uniqueness isn\u2019t just in their appearance, but also in how they can be combined</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recognition and splitting: </strong><i>Hello, you've been chosen, come out for a bit</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown farewell: </strong><i>Like life, some things gradually disappear and cannot be saved</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Wordban to your wishlist now and witness Wordo's full evolution!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010About this game\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/46da6b629cf6d8cae47e19cf36f90831.webp?t=1750845125\" width=37 height=38 /></span>Hi there! <strong>Wordban</strong>'s free demo is ready! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wordban</strong> is a text-based Sokoban-style game where you control the adorable <strong>Wordo</strong> to push boxes and trigger each level's innovative text rules, changing the layout, quantity, and even the attributes of the boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/6f1136544dd2c6f256ec6ab55815c2b9.poster.avif?t=1750845125\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/6f1136544dd2c6f256ec6ab55815c2b9.webm?t=1750845125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/6f1136544dd2c6f256ec6ab55815c2b9.mp4?t=1750845125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/c4584c9c9a66cdc888723dea4de78ae7.webp?t=1750845125\" width=38 height=36 /></span>With your strategy, <strong>Wordo</strong> can make boxes multiply, merge into one, drip through stone, or even turn into gold! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Wordban Demo</strong>, you can enjoy a free preview of the game's 1st chapter: <strong>The Room</strong>, featuring 20 unique levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/004b772183ad2d21e6b6e064923e3438.poster.avif?t=1750845125\" width=800 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/004b772183ad2d21e6b6e064923e3438.webm?t=1750845125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/004b772183ad2d21e6b6e064923e3438.mp4?t=1750845125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/f1c2a2cf9cffae6c7154e5308392ceb2.webp?t=1750845125\" width=38 height=38 /></span>Awaken <strong>Wordo</strong> and enjoy the special puzzle-solving fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/c4584c9c9a66cdc888723dea4de78ae7.webp?t=1750845125\" width=38 height=36 /></span><strong>\u3010New\u3011What have we been up to since we last met?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who participated in the last Next Fest! Based on your feedback, we\u2019ve made the following improvements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoother difficulty curve</strong>: We've restructured the level order to make it easier for newcomers to get started, while offering veteran players a fresh challenge rhythm!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear levels with free exploration</strong>: A brand-new level selection interface that maintains a clear structure while allowing free jumps between levels to revisit your favorites.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope these optimizations bring you a smoother puzzle-solving experience if you're a fan of Sokoban games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the real surprise will be in the upcoming full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/f1c2a2cf9cffae6c7154e5308392ceb2.webp?t=1750845125\" width=38 height=38 /></span><strong>\u3010New\u3011What\u2019s coming in the full version? A sneak peek!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the full version, we\u2019re bringing even more brain-teasing concepts to \u201ctext-based Sokoban\u201d:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*To preserve the ultimate experience of the full version, the following mechanics will not be included in the demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box transformations: </strong><i>Anything can transform</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little critters: </strong><i>Their uniqueness isn\u2019t just in their appearance, but also in how they can be combined</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recognition and splitting: </strong><i>Hello, you've been chosen, come out for a bit</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown farewell: </strong><i>Like life, some things gradually disappear and cannot be saved</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Wordban to your wishlist now and witness Wordo's full evolution!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010About this game\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126790/extras/46da6b629cf6d8cae47e19cf36f90831.webp?t=1750845125\" width=37 height=38 /></span>Hi there! <strong>Wordban</strong>'s free demo is ready! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wordban</strong> is a text-based Sokoban-style game where you control the adorable <strong>Wordo</strong> to push boxes and trigger each level's innovative text rules, changing the layout, quantity, and even the attributes of the boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste